config VMXNET3
    tristate "VMware VMXNET3 Ethernet"
    default y
    help
      Native VMware VMXNET3 (15ad:07b0) Ethernet using revision 1 and UPT 1,
      one TX and RX queue, and software protocol checksums. Each PCI function
      registers an independent NIC with the existing network stack.
      With M, build vmxnet3.ko with owner-aware STOP and cleanup.
